ing the feat (D35E's linked items add it), in place of D35E's own. Specialist wizard variants (Wizard, school: the specialist school they belong to): each replaces the familiar (Summon Familiar), the wizard bonus feats (dropBonusFeats) or the specialty spell (noSlot); skillsAdd: more class skills; feats: [class level, feat] given without a slot; bonusFeatsFrom: the wizard bonus feat list changed (removeMetamagic, add).",
